  "notes": "USAGE:\nA relatively formal word often used in news, business, and official contexts. In casual speech, {避|さ}ける (to avoid) is more common.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {危険|きけん}を{回避|かいひ}する (to avoid danger)\n- {事故|じこ}を{回避|かいひ}する (to avert an accident)\n- リスクを{回避|かいひ}する (to avoid risk)\n- {衝突|しょうとつ}を{回避|かいひ}する (to avoid a collision)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {避|さ}ける: to avoid — more casual and broadly used, while {回避|かいひ}する implies strategic or deliberate avoidance",
